WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.510
This is JobNet Application, Katlego's career pipeline in one app.

2
00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:11.530
It ranks job listings against real CV evidence and explains every match, using on-device sentence embeddings or a keyword fallback.

3
00:00:11.540 --> 00:00:16.880
Pick a role, and AI Hawk drafts a cover note and CV synopsis built only from published facts.

4
00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:19.570
Anything it can't back up stays a placeholder.

5
00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:22.700
You review it, then copy it or forward it yourself.

6
00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:25.690
Nothing is ever sent or applied for automatically.

7
00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:31.050
Around the draft sits a toolkit of fifteen tools, from an honest ATS check to interview prep.
